    "body": "fix on issue/1446-rest-adaptive-op · PR #2890 · pinned by the_rest_adaptive_pass_cuts_what_the_simulated_roughing_pass_left, a_stock_that_does_not_prove_an_entry_is_refused_by_name, what_the_rest_planner_does_not_read_is_refused_by_name_at_the_edit, a_document_past_the_door_is_refused_at_generation, the_group_is_an_undoable_edit_a_project_file_key_and_moves_the_stamp, mcp_sets_the_group_refuses_the_entered_tool_undoes_and_the_project_keeps_it, the_adaptive_rest_group_moves_the_stamp, each_guard_is_pinned_and_its_removal_fails_the_pin, the_column_stock_of_the_previous_operations_plans_the_rest_adaptive_pass · merges at the next cut\n\nNotes for the reviewer:\n\n- The PR is a `feat` and is stacked on #2822 (#2033). Merge #2822 first.\n- The PR adds the rest group to the 2D Adaptive operation. The group reads the previous operations only. An entered previous tool is refused by name on a 2D Adaptive.\n- The PR body says `Fixes #1446`. Work that stays open is in other issues: #2033 (PR #2822), #2032 (entry with clearance proved for the full cutter, 2D Pocket), #2884 (the rows on the 2D Adaptive page), #2885 (the MCP skill row).\n- The quick gate is green on head 3914606bf (359 steps, 0 failed).\n",
